title: ubatch size for a 2048-token prompt  (R1 7B Q4_K_S, q8_0 KV on GPU)
args: -m /home/wrekt/.lmstudio/models/mradermacher/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B-Uncensored-i1-GGUF/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B-Uncensored.i1-Q4_K_S.gguf -ngl 99 -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0 -t 6 -fa 1 -d 0 -p 2048 -n 0 -b 2048 -r 3
ub 512 (default) | build-live | | -ub 512
ub 1024 | build-live | | -ub 1024
ub 2048 | build-live | | -ub 2048
ub 512 again | build-live | | -ub 512
ub 1024 again | build-live | | -ub 1024
ub 2048 again | build-live | | -ub 2048
